/P 156 0 R
/E (The project can contribute to SDG 10: Reduced Inequalities by exploring computational methods that may support scalable and accessible mental-health monitoring. Digital platforms can provide large-scale sources of information without requiring physical access to a monitoring facility. However, the system should be developed responsibly so that differences in language, culture, digital access, and data representation do not create unfair outcomes.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
