/P 157 0 R
/E (The proposed workflow begins with collection and preparation of suitable multimodal social media data. Text will be cleaned and transformed into suitable representations, while images will be resized, normalised, and converted into visual features. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [7]
>>
