/P 158 0 R
/E (Model performance will be evaluated using accuracy, precision, recall, and F1-score. A confusion matrix will be used to analyse classification errors across different classes. The performance of the multimodal model will be compared with text-only and image-only approaches. These comparisons will help determine whether combining multiple modalities provides measurable performance improvements.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
436 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 158 0 R
/E (The dataset will be selected from a publicly available research dataset containing social media posts with corresponding textual and visual information. The selected dataset will be examined for the number of samples, available modalities, class labels, and data quality before model development. Appropriate preprocessing will be performed to remove irrelevant or noisy information. The final dataset selection will depend on the availability of both text and image data and suitable mental-health-related labels.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
