/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 159 0 R
/E (The project is expected to produce an AI-based framework capable of combining textual and visual information for mental-health-related sentiment analysis. It will provide separate and multimodal models for analysing social media content and a comparison of their performance. The study is also expected to identify the benefits and limitations of multimodal feature fusion for this application. The resulting framework and findings can provide a basis for further research in AI-based mental-health monitoring.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [5]
>>
